{"version":1,"key":"card:652","content":{"id":652,"content":[{"children":[{"text":"在琢磨 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"破窗效应","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"231b562b-2cf2-4726-9991-dfafcafdbeed","contentId":4906,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":651,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" 和 ","type":"formatted"},{"children":[{"text":"滑梯效应","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"9c734495-4b06-4bdf-bfd1-41ee76183d83","contentId":4900,"contentTitle":"","contentType":"card","refId":649,"tauContract":"720a42c66441f65bfc897253311b73deb687a68a60da46dffe8c7b8537a65760","type":"content-link"},{"text":" 时，我发现这两个概念非常相似：它们都在强调“第一步”——无论是打破第一扇窗，还是踏上滑梯的顶端，都会让事态不可避免地滑向混乱。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"0b4d18b3-8c8a-4357-bd68-c9bb6b563951","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"但仔细拆解后，会发现两者的侧重点其实大有径庭：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"d62883a8-050f-4b2f-9dc2-75ba1f9cfa7a","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"bold":true,"text":"破窗效应","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：更侧重于","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"环境的暗示作用","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。它在探讨一种社会心理，即一个破败的信号（第一扇破窗）是如何诱发群体性的放任，最终导致犯罪或秩序崩塌。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a79cde92-2afb-4d36-8aee-196c1b9ee32d","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"b89a2b5e-578f-4d18-9438-eb0d21c9aa38","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"bold":true,"text":"滑梯效应","type":"formatted"},{"text":"：更侧重于","type":"formatted"},{"bold":true,"text":"行为的惯性力量","type":"formatted"},{"text":"。它解释了为什么一旦你主动迈出了那一步，就会产生一种“身不由己”的加速度，让你极难在中途止损，只能直奔深渊。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"800cb292-7ba2-4428-a8a0-7dec047efcf9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"c5e48dc3-0ad6-4409-86f2-8668952fce85","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"9cd859e3-3fee-499b-8669-04dc60348dc1","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"},{"calloutType":"info","children":[{"children":[{"text":"想象你在尝试“减肥”这件事：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"1993ac8c-2a5c-49be-a5ee-e89ba00c3e8f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"bold":true,"text":"破窗效应","type":"formatted"},{"text":"是：你看到桌上已经堆满了别人吃剩的包装袋（破窗），于是心想“反正这屋子已经这么乱了，大家都在吃”，你也跟着撕开了一包薯片。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"dea1b5b3-2db4-42d0-ae68-5e0b710a4ffb","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"7c284bd4-1832-425c-9e7c-888ac0b818f9","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"bold":true,"text":"滑梯效应","type":"formatted"},{"text":"是：你心软对自己说“就吃这一口”（迈出第一步），结果这一口多巴胺瞬间击垮了你的意志力，让你根本停不下来，最后演变成暴饮暴食的一顿大餐。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"461e4fbd-1cc8-4078-b5a9-22052e07cc95","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"30135ffe-1352-422b-a679-76bbde0ac98c","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"0cb1376a-434f-43a0-ba65-c38ad3ca9c21","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"collabId":"4bd27c60-71a0-4dba-8eeb-5cf226896dac","tauContract":"82a3e58fc7df817d12ed2ff5fb675ef0d468689701d99d9471018c2dbd8a3221","title":"举个例子","type":"callout"}],"tags":["概念对比"],"createTime":1767144500750,"updateTime":1793532613994,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1793532613994},"links":{"card:651":{"key":"card:651","type":"card","id":651},"card:649":{"key":"card:649","type":"card","id":649}}}